WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.341
If your mind is split between three different tabs and some looming deadline, you are not leading.

2
00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:08.281
You are just reacting.

3
00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.281
In phase one, we seal the leak.

4
00:00:11.341 --> 00:00:16.381
We start with The Sanctuary.

5
00:00:16.441 --> 00:00:22.740
We are going to empty your head and close the open loops that keep you awake at 2 a.m.

6
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:26.820
This is the decompression ritual that ensures you do not

7
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.520
bring the weather of the office into the kitchen.

8
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.800
It is not flashy work, but without a stable mind, you

9
00:00:34.861 --> 00:00:39.780
cannot lead a stable home. So we start with The Sanctuary.
